          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>A custom promise ring turns a meaningful commitment into something that feels connected to the people making it. Instead of choosing a ring simply because it looks beautiful, you can select details that represent a person, date, memory or shared part of your story.</p><p>Your ring might feature a birthstone connected to someone special, a color that holds personal meaning or two stones representing two people.</p><p>At The Promise Co, the promise always comes first. </p><p>Our personalized promise rings are designed to help you create something meaningful without placing rules or expectations around what that promise should mean.</p>"
